sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title Diagramme d'Interaction des Classes Internes : Job Board & Recruitment Service

    participant Ctrl as JobBoardController
    participant Svc as JobBoardService
    participant GamifClient as GamificationRestClient
    participant PostRepo as JobPostingRepository
    participant AppRepo as JobApplicationRepository
    participant AppEnt as JobApplication (Entity)
    participant EventPub as RabbitMQEventPublisher
    participant BadgeConsumer as BadgeUnlockedConsumer

    Note over Ctrl,EventPub: Scénario 1 : Candidature Certifiée (REST Synchrone & Publication)
    Ctrl->>Svc: applyToJob(jobId, candidateId)
    Svc->>GamifClient: getCertifiedProfile(candidateId) [REST Synchrone]
    GamifClient-->>Svc: CertifiedProfileDto(xp=3250, badges=["Java Master"])
    Svc->>PostRepo: findById(jobId)
    PostRepo-->>Svc: jobPosting
    Svc->>Svc: calculateMatchingScore(posting, profile) -> score = 94%
    Svc->>AppEnt: new JobApplication(jobId, candidateId, score=94)
    Svc->>AppRepo: save(application)
    Svc->>EventPub: publishJobApplicationSubmittedEvent(applicationId, recruiterId) [RabbitMQ]
    Svc-->>Ctrl: ApplicationResponseDto(applicationId, score=94)

    Note over BadgeConsumer,Svc: Scénario 2 : Recalcul Matching (Consommation Asynchrone)
    BadgeConsumer->>Svc: handleBadgeUnlocked(BadgeUnlockedEvent)
    Svc->>Svc: refreshMatchedJobsForCandidate(candidateId)
